# Omarchy OPTIONAL pre-installs (FAST-INSTALL.md C2).
#
# The AUTHORITY is the pinned runtime's bin/omarchy-remove-preinstalls at
# iso/RUNTIME: it removes exactly these 13 packages (plus web-app launchers,
# TUI wrappers and mise stubs). bin/omarchy-install-preinstalls restores the
# same set. If the runtime's list moves, THIS file moves with it in the same
# commit -- a test asserts the two argv lists are identical.
#
# What preinstalls=no skips, by layer (nothing is hidden to make the timer
# look faster):
#
#   these 13 PACKAGES   never enter the minimal image and the early delta
#                       never installs them (this file is the delta's
#                       allow-list). No install-then-remove on the fast path.
#   launchers/wrappers  GENERATED post-install by omarchy-refresh-applications
#   + mise stubs        (never baked into any image). preinstalls=no skips
#                       the add step; late runs the canonical removal tools
#                       after user provisioning and leaves the
#                       preinstalls-removed marker, so the desktop offers
#                       Install > Preinstalls (FAST-INSTALL.md C6).
#
# The common minimal root image EXCLUDES all 13 (builder strips them at image
# time); they stay in the offline mirror, and the early optional delta reads
# THIS file from /usr/share/omarchy-iso/deck-preinstalls.packages on the
# LIVE ISO to install them offline for preinstalls=yes. BARE names: the delta
# resolves against the single-repo offline mirror.
aether
cliamp
libreoffice-fresh
xournalpp
pinta
obsidian
obs-studio
kdenlive
moonlight-qt
lazydocker
omacut
omacalc
omawrite
